t 260 in daily order fees, and pooling two days of demand cuts shortages. Extra storage costs about as much as the fees saved. Likely top half.\n- **Candidate 0 (orders every 3 days, about 1.05×):** saves about 360 in fees, and pooling three days reduces shortage risk more. Storage costs more (I estimate about 580), but nothing spoils, because each batch sells out before its expiry. Lean top half, with less confidence."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5060, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5060}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:31:53.449Z", "request_id": "req_011CgW8wHirPJ5f6iipQineG"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01BghG22oZQudEaCESfhtw7C", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgW8wHzUFutQ2mTjG1oXn", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01BghG22oZQudEaCESfhtw7C", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.55, 0.15, 0.65, 0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.6, 0.45]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5060, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5060}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "stan